            "<strong>Simple Social Buttons<\/strong> by <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/wpbrigade.com\/?utm_source=simple-social-buttons-lite&utm_medium=link-header&utm_campaign=pro-upgrade\">WPBrigade<\/a><\/strong> adds an advanced set of social media sharing buttons to your WordPress sites, such as: <strong>Facebook<\/strong>, <strong>Twitter\/X<\/strong>, <strong>LinkedIn<\/strong>, <strong>WhatsApp<\/strong>, <strong>Viber<\/strong>, <strong>Reddit<\/strong> and <strong>Pinterest<\/strong>. This makes it the most flexible social sharing plugin for everyone.": [
                "<strong>Jednostavna dru\u0161tvena dugmad<\/strong> od <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/wpbrigade.com\/?utm_source=simple-social-buttons-lite&utm_medium=link-header&utm_campaign=pro-upgrade\">WPBrigade<\/a><\/strong> dodaje napredni set dugmadi za deljenje na dru\u0161tvenim mre\u017eama na va\u0161e WordPress sajtove, kao \u0161to su: <strong>Facebook<\/strong>, <strong>Twitter\/X<\/strong>, <strong>LinkedIn<\/strong>, <strong>WhatsApp<\/strong>, <strong>Viber<\/strong>, <strong>Reddit<\/strong> i <strong>Pinterest<\/strong>. Ovo ga \u010dini najfleksibilnijim dodatkom za deljenje na dru\u0161tvenim mre\u017eama za sve."
            ],
            "Control how share buttons appear on images and media within your posts.": [
                "Kontroli\u0161ite kako se dugmad za deljenje prikazuju na slikama i medijima unutar va\u0161ih postova."
            ],
            "Configure your share popup: set the message, timing, and trigger behavior.": [
                "Konfiguri\u0161ite va\u0161 iska\u010du\u0107i prozor za deljenje: postavite poruku, vreme i pona\u0161anje okida\u010da."
            ],
            "Set up a slide-in share prompt with custom messaging, position, and timing": [
                "Postavite iska\u010du\u0107i prozor za deljenje sa prilago\u0111enim porukama, pozicijom i vremenom"
            ],
            "HTTP\/HTTPS Counts Resolve": [
                "HTTP\/HTTPS Broj Resolucija"
            ],
            "hour": [
                "sat"
            ],
            "hours": [
                "sati"
            ],
            "Internal share click counts are recorded for supported networks (for example Twitter\/X, LinkedIn, WhatsApp) when visitors use the sharing buttons on your site. Counts are stored locally and are not sent to those social networks. Clear your page cache after upgrading the plugin so button markup stays in sync.": [
                "Interni brojevi klikova za deljenje se bele\u017ee za podr\u017eane mre\u017ee (na primer Twitter\/X, LinkedIn, WhatsApp) kada posetioci koriste dugmad za deljenje na va\u0161em sajtu. Brojevi se \u010duvaju lokalno i ne \u0161alju se tim dru\u0161tvenim mre\u017eama. O\u010distite ke\u0161 stranice nakon nadogradnje dodatka kako bi se markup dugmadi sinhronizovao."
            ],
            "Enable to remove all settings upon uninstalling the plugin.": [
                "Omogu\u0107i da se svi parametri uklone prilikom deinstalacije dodatka."
            ],
            "Enable to reset all settings back to default upon saving.": [
                "Omogu\u0107i da se svi parametri resetuju na podrazumevane prilikom \u010duvanja."
            ],
            "Click To Post": [
                "Kliknite za post"
            ],
            "Unlock Click to Tweet Feature with Pro!": [
                "Otklju\u010dajte Kliknite da Tweetujete funkciju sa Pro!"
            ],
            "Get the powerful Click to Tweet functionality that lets you create engaging, tweetable content directly in your posts. This Pro feature helps increase social engagement and drive more traffic to your site.": [
                "Dobijte mo\u0107nu Kliknite da Tweetujete funkcionalnost koja vam omogu\u0107ava da kreirate zanimljiv, tvitabilan sadr\u017eaj direktno u va\u0161im postovima. Ova Pro funkcija poma\u017ee u pove\u0107anju dru\u0161tvene anga\u017eovanosti i dovla\u010denju vi\u0161e saobra\u0107aja na va\u0161 sajt."
            ],
