            "Configure how your inline share buttons appear within your content.": [
                "Konfiguri\u0161ite kako se va\u0161a inline dugmad za deljenje prikazuju unutar va\u0161eg sadr\u017eaja."
            ],
            "For Facebook share count you need to add Facebook App ID and Secret in the Social tab.": [
                "Za broj deljenja na Facebook-u potrebno je dodati Facebook App ID i Secret na Socijalnoj kartici."
            ],
            "Show only a set number of icons in your content. Remaining icons open in a popup when visitors tap the + button.": [
                "Prika\u017eite samo odre\u0111eni broj ikona u va\u0161em sadr\u017eaju. Preostale ikone se otvaraju u iska\u010du\u0107em prozoru kada posetioci dodirnu dugme +."
