            ],
            "Show only a set number of icons in the sidebar. Remaining icons open in a popup when visitors tap the + button.": [
                "Prikazujte samo odre\u0111eni broj ikona u bo\u010dnom panelu. Preostale ikone se otvaraju u iska\u010du\u0107em prozoru kada posetioci pritisnu dugme +."
