            ],
            "Facebook App Secret": [
                "Facebook App Secret"
            ],
            "Snapchat uses Snap Creative Kit Web so mobile visitors open the Snapchat app with your page link ready to share.": [
                "Snapchat koristi Snap Creative Kit Web tako da mobilni posetioci otvore Snapchat aplikaciju sa va\u0161om stranicom spremnom za deljenje."
            ],
            "Snap Kit Client ID (optional)": [
                "Snap Kit Client ID (opciono)"
            ],
            "Optional. Add your Snap Kit Client ID to attribute shares in the Snap Kit developer portal. Sharing works without it.": [
                "Opcionalno. Dodajte va\u0161 Snap Kit Client ID da biste pripisali deljenja u Snap Kit developerskom portalu. Deljenje funkcioni\u0161e i bez njega."
            ],
            "How it works": [
                "Kako to funkcioni\u0161e"
            ],
            "Add Snapchat from the Settings tab like any other button.": [
                "Dodajte Snapchat iz taba Pode\u0161avanja kao bilo koji drugi dugme."
            ],
            "On mobile, tapping the button opens the Snapchat app share flow for the current page.": [
                "Na mobilnom, dodirivanje dugmeta otvara deljenje u Snapchat aplikaciji za trenutnu stranicu."
            ],
            "On desktop, a Snapcode window opens so users can scan and share from their phone.": [
                "Na desktop-u, otvara se prozor Snapcode-a kako bi korisnici mogli da skeniraju i dele sa svog telefona."
            ],
            "Keep Open Graph tags enabled so Snapchat can show your page title and preview.": [
                "Dr\u017eite Open Graph oznake omogu\u0107ene kako bi Snapchat mogao da prikazuje naslov va\u0161e stranice i pregled."
            ],
            "Official Buttons": [
                "Zvani\u010dna dugmad"
            ],
            "Choose a button style that fits your site's look and feel.": [
                "Izaberite stil dugmeta koji odgovara izgledu i ose\u0107aju va\u0161eg sajta."
            ],
            "Dismiss this notice.": [
                "Odbaci ovu obave\u0161tenje."
            ],
            "Dismiss": [
                "Odbaci"
            ],
            "Share on LinkedIn": [
                "Podeli na LinkedIn-u"
            ],
            "Simple Social Buttons Pro lets you set custom background, hover, and icon colors for every button, so they blend naturally with your website's design instead of standing out like a default plugin. Buttons that fit your site tend to get clicked more, which means more shares and more traffic for you. Pro also adds features like buttons on images, popups on exit intent, fly in slide animations, and more.": [
                "Simple Social Buttons Pro vam omogu\u0107ava da postavite prilago\u0111enu pozadinu, boje pri prelazu i boje ikona za svako dugme, tako da se prirodno uklapaju u dizajn va\u0161eg sajta umesto da se isti\u010du kao standardni dodatak. Dugmad koja odgovaraju va\u0161em sajtu obi\u010dno dobijaju vi\u0161e klikova, \u0161to zna\u010di vi\u0161e deljenja i vi\u0161e saobra\u0107aja za vas. Pro tako\u0111e dodaje funkcije kao \u0161to su dugmad na slikama, iska\u010du\u0107i prozori pri nameri izlaska, animacije klizanja i jo\u0161 mnogo toga."
            ],
            "Simple Social Buttons Pro lets you display share buttons directly on images and photos across your posts and pages, choose their position, add icon spacing, and set custom colors that match your site. You can also hide them on mobile and control exactly which post types they appear on. It's an easy way to turn every image into a shareable opportunity and drive more traffic.": [
                "Simple Social Buttons Pro vam omogu\u0107ava da prika\u017eete dugmad za deljenje direktno na slikama i fotografijama \u0161irom va\u0161ih postova i stranica, izaberete njihovu poziciju, dodate razmak izme\u0111u ikona i postavite prilago\u0111ene boje koje odgovaraju va\u0161em sajtu. Tako\u0111e ih mo\u017eete sakriti na mobilnim ure\u0111ajima i ta\u010dno kontrolisati na kojim vrstama postova se pojavljuju. To je jednostavan na\u010din da svaku sliku pretvorite u priliku za deljenje i pove\u0107ate saobra\u0107aj."
            ],
            "Simple Social Buttons Pro lets you create a custom share popup with your own title and message, and trigger it exactly when it matters, like before visitors leave or after they scroll. You can add animation, display share counts or total shares to build social proof, and set custom colors to match your brand. It's a smart way to catch visitor attention right when they're most likely to share.": [
                "Simple Social Buttons Pro vam omogu\u0107ava da kreirate prilago\u0111eni iska\u010du\u0107i prozor sa va\u0161im naslovom i porukom, i da ga aktivirate ta\u010dno kada je to va\u017eno, kao pre nego \u0161to posetioci odu ili nakon \u0161to se pomere. Mo\u017eete dodati animaciju, prikazati brojeve deljenja ili ukupna deljenja da biste izgradili dru\u0161tveni dokaz, i postaviti prilago\u0111ene boje koje odgovaraju va\u0161em brendu. To je pametan na\u010din da privu\u010dete pa\u017enju posetilaca u trenutku kada su najverovatnije da podele."
            ],
            "Simple Social Buttons Pro lets you create a custom Fly In box with your own title and message, choose its position and animation, and even display share counts or total shares to build social proof. You can fine-tune timing, icon spacing, and colors to match your brand, and control which post types it appears on. It's a great way to prompt visitors to share right when they're most engaged.": [
                "Simple Social Buttons Pro vam omogu\u0107ava da kreirate prilago\u0111eni Fly In okvir sa va\u0161im naslovom i porukom, izaberete njegovu poziciju i animaciju, i \u010dak prika\u017eete brojeve deljenja ili ukupna deljenja da biste izgradili dru\u0161tveni dokaz. Mo\u017eete fino podesiti vreme, razmak izme\u0111u ikona i boje da odgovaraju va\u0161em brendu, i kontrolisati na kojim vrstama postova se pojavljuje. To je odli\u010dan na\u010din da podstaknete posetioce da dele u trenutku kada su najvi\u0161e anga\u017eovani."
            ],
